      "summaries": {
        "en": "Understand-Anything transforms any codebase into an interactive knowledge graph, enabling developers to explore, search, and ask questions about their code. Its key insight is using graph-based representations to capture relationships between code components, making complex systems navigable. You can integrate it with AI coding assistants like Claude Code or Copilot to instantly visualize and query your project's architecture, accelerating onboarding and debugging.",
        "zh": "Understand-Anything 能将任意代码库转化为交互式知识图谱，让开发者可以直观地探索、搜索并提问代码逻辑。其核心创新在于利用图结构表示代码组件间的关联，将复杂系统变得可导航。你可以将其与 Claude Code、Copilot 等 AI 编程助手集成，即时可视化项目架构并自然语言查询，从而加速新手上手和调试过程。",
        "es": "Understand-Anything transforms any codebase into an interactive knowledge graph, enabling developers to explore, search, and ask questions about their code. Its key insight is using graph-based representations to capture relationships between code components, making complex systems navigable. You can integrate it with AI coding assistants like Claude Code or Copilot to instantly visualize and query your project's architecture, accelerating onboarding and debugging.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "Understand-Anything stands out for antigravity-skills, business-knowledge, and claude-code in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Understand-Anything transforms any codebase into an interactive knowledge graph, enabling developers to explore, search, and ask questions about their code. Its key insight is using graph-based representations to capture relationships between code components, making complex systems navigable. You can integrate it with AI coding assistants like Claude Code or Copilot to instantly visualize and query your project's architecture, accelerating onboarding and debugging.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/Lum1104/Understand-Anything for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
