      "summaries": {
        "en": "s-ui is an advanced web panel designed for managing SagerNet/Sing-Box proxies, simplifying the configuration of multi-protocol proxies like Hysteria, Shadowsocks, and VLESS. Its key strength lies in providing a unified, intuitive interface for complex proxy setups, reducing manual errors. You can deploy it to centrally manage proxy nodes, monitor traffic, and adjust rules in real time, making it ideal for personal or small-team proxy infrastructure management.",
        "zh": "s-ui 是一款专为 SagerNet/Sing-Box 代理设计的进阶网页面板，旨在简化 Hysteria、Shadowsocks、VLESS 等多协议代理的配置与管理。其核心优势在于通过统一直观界面，将复杂设置流程化，降低手动配置错误率。技术亮点包括原生多协议支持、实时流量监控及灵活规则调整。部署于服务器后，可集中管理节点、监控网络状态并动态调整策略，适合个人或小团队搭建稳定易维护的代理基础设施，无需频繁修改配置文件即可快速切换协议或更新规则，提升运维效率。",
        "es": "s-ui is an advanced web panel designed for managing SagerNet/Sing-Box proxies, simplifying the configuration of multi-protocol proxies like Hysteria, Shadowsocks, and VLESS. Its key strength lies in providing a unified, intuitive interface for complex proxy setups, reducing manual errors. You can deploy it to centrally manage proxy nodes, monitor traffic, and adjust rules in real time, making it ideal for personal or small-team proxy infrastructure management.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "s-ui stands out for hysteria, hysteria2, and naive-proxy in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "s-ui is an advanced web panel designed for managing SagerNet/Sing-Box proxies, simplifying the configuration of multi-protocol proxies like Hysteria, Shadowsocks, and VLESS. Its key strength lies in providing a unified, intuitive interface for complex proxy setups, reducing manual errors. You can deploy it to centrally manage proxy nodes, monitor traffic, and adjust rules in real time, making it ideal for personal or small-team proxy infrastructure management.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/alireza0/s-ui for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
